{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：11:48 2026-11-16 HKT<br/>發佈時間：11:48 2026-11-16 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：11:48 2026-11-16 HKT</p><img alt=\"DeepSeek傳算力不足 限制App及網頁版使用\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl_square/4fe01acc5aa56a9708efed8967698538/2026-11/2026-10-27T103746Z_158210146_RC2B6OAYI5WA_RTRMADP_3_AI-SAFETY-DEEPSEEK_1200x675.jpg\"/><p>據內媒報道，多名DeepSeek用戶今日（16日）反映，App及網頁版出現新的使用限制。據用戶收到的提示顯示，平台因「算力不足」，不再支援超過7天未有使用的長對話。</p><p>另有用戶指，單次輸入文字的上限縮至約4萬字，平台亦設每日對話用量上限。當日用量達到上限時，系統會提示「因伺服器繁忙，使用額度已達上限」。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T04:12:03.240752+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":234,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T03:48:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T04:05:36.107936+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T04:05:36.107936+00:00","content_hash":"7dc3ce3367428c5bfd0bae32eb2334ef22a616da6a720e16600af7662e56a32d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}